                "Also — is the six-week close a guarantee or an average?",
                "",
                "Dana"
            ])
        },
        {
            "id": "m2",
            "from": "Marcus Oyelaran",
            "address": "marcus@orlo.example",
            "subject": "Re: reference call",
            "at": t - 3600 * 9,
            "unread": true,
            "body": joinl([
                "Happy to take the call. Thursday after 15:00 works, or any time Friday morning.",
                "",
                "One condition: I will say what went wrong in month one, not just what worked.",
