                "Marcus"
            ])
        },
        {
            "id": "m3",
            "from": "Priya Raman",
            "address": "priya@melrose.example",
            "subject": "Question about the freight allocation",
            "at": t - 3600 * 27,
            "unread": false,
            "body": joinl([
                "We split freight by weight today and it takes two people a day. Does the system",
                "support that natively, or do we keep the spreadsheet for that part?",
